config USB_EHCI_HCD
    tristate "EHCI USB 2.0 storage and HID host controller"
    default y
    help
      PCI EHCI high-speed USB2, Bulk-Only SCSI flash storage and boot HID
      keyboard/mouse, including USB2 hub transaction translators.
      Low/full-speed root-port devices require a UHCI companion controller;
      enable USB_UHCI_HCD for VMware's USB2 controller. M builds ehci.ko.
      This is an EHCI driver, not support for USB2 ports owned by xHCI.
